{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はMJ収録して来たよ♪\n放送近くなったらまた\nお知らせしまーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20,21日は名古屋での握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん楽しんでもらえたかなぁ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握では大和とペア♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わった後に、\n真夏のファンの人\nいい人ばっかだね！\n今日はありがとう♪\nって大和がいってくれて\n嬉しくなっちゃった\\(^^ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大和のファンの方も\nみんな優しくて握手が\nすっごく楽しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日ありがとうございました！\nまたよろしくね(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/22/9628210/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日は\n個別握手会でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"常連さんにもお久しぶりさんにも\nはじめましてさんにも\nいっぱい元気もらっちゃったなぁ♡\n本当にありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服は1・5部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/22/9628210/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニット:snidel\nスカート:Lily Brown\nパンプス:RANDA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/09/22/9628210/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このスカート羽で出来てるの〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニットは少しだけ肩が出てる\nオフショルニット☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragr